classDiagram
  accTitle: DOT-Design core concepts and relationships
  accDescr: A reusable Dot declares Skills and Contracts, names Anchors, and supports Runtime alternatives. Runtimes target Platforms and offer Deployments. Deployments define Services. A Composition selects named vertices that reference exact Dot releases and deployments. Edges connect vertices. Each Channel uses Connectors to select Anchors on the two endpoint vertices.
  direction TB

  class Dot {
    +String id
    +String name
    +Version version
    +List~Skill~ skills
    +List~Contract~ contracts
    +List~Anchor~ anchors
    +List~Runtime~ runtimes
  }
  class Skill {
    +String id
    +String name
  }
  class Contract {
    +String id
    +ContractStandard standard
    +Payload payload
  }
  class Anchor {
    +String id
    +AnchorDirection direction
    +AnchorContract contract
  }
  class Runtime {
    +Platform platform
    +List~Deployment~ deployments
  }
  class Platform {
    +PlatformEngine engine
    +Version version
  }
  class Deployment {
    +String id
    +Manifest manifest
    +Set~Service~ services
  }
  class Manifest {
    +ManifestType type
  }
  class Service {
    +String id
    +List~ServicePort~ ports
    +Configuration config
  }
  class Composition {
    +UUID id
    +List~Vertex~ vertices
    +List~Edge~ edges
  }
  class Vertex {
    +String name
    +String source
    +String dotId
    +String dotVersion
    +String deployment
  }
  class Edge {
    +String name
    +String from
    +String to
  }
  class Channel {
    +String name
    +String fromConnector
    +String toConnector
  }
  class Connector {
    +String anchorId
  }

  Dot "1" *-- "0..*" Skill : declares
  Dot "1" *-- "0..*" Contract : owns interfaces
  Dot "1" *-- "0..*" Anchor : names integration points
  Dot "1" *-- "1..*" Runtime : supports
  Anchor ..> Contract : selects operations
  Runtime "1" *-- "1" Platform : targets
  Runtime "1" *-- "1..*" Deployment : offers alternatives
  Deployment "1" *-- "1" Manifest : describes how to deploy
  Deployment "1" *-- "1..*" Service : materializes
  Composition "1" *-- "1..*" Vertex : selects named tool
  Vertex ..> Dot : references exact release
  Vertex ..> Deployment : selects
  Composition "1" *-- "0..*" Edge : connects
  Edge ..> Vertex : from / to
  Edge "1" *-- "1..*" Channel : channels
  Vertex "1" *-- "0..*" Connector : connectors
  Channel ..> Connector : selects endpoints
  Connector ..> Anchor : resolves within vertex
